alculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 July to August fell to 32% of normal on the middle, and November to December to 42%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 44% of normal on the middle and June to July at 151%. Grid 19670 had its driest year in 1960 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
